[00:00.00]<00:00.00>作<00:00.19>词<00:00.38>: <00:00.58>daiki <00:00.77>torii<00:00.97>
[00:00.97]<00:00.97>作<00:01.16>曲<00:01.35>: <00:01.55>daiki <00:01.74>torii<00:01.94>
[00:01.94]<00:01.94>编<00:02.13>曲<00:02.32>: <00:02.52>daiki <00:02.71>torii<00:03.71>
[00:36.22]I thought a new day would come,
[00:36.22]我曾相信我能迎来新的黎明
[00:40.14]believed hope would save me,
[00:40.14]相信希望最终能拯救我
[00:46.86]Wanted to live in a peace and not question anyone's mind.
[00:46.86]希望过上和平的生活 不再需要互相猜忌
[00:57.96]That hope crumbled with a thud.
[00:57.96]希望砰然粉碎
[01:03.12]In the face of death,
[01:03.12]直面死亡
[01:05.36]changed way of life.
[01:05.36]我选择了抗争
[01:08.16]So don't need to be afraid.
[01:08.16]所以啊 不必恐惧
[01:11.15]Think only of finding a way.
[01:11.15]去思考怎样找到生存之道就好
[01:16.18]No crying.
[01:16.18]无需哭泣
[01:18.76]Tell me how the fact.
[01:18.76]告诉我何为事实吧
[01:21.70]Blind to heart's shadows?
[01:21.70]是未曾察觉内心的灰影吗？
[01:24.54]I can only turn away by laughing and fooling around.
[01:24.54]唯有用笑容掩饰 我才能得以逃避
[01:30.56]Will that urging within me grow bigger someday?
[01:30.56]栖息于我内心的冲动 最终仍会膨胀失控吗？
[01:38.00]This wasn't magic as I knew it.
[01:38.00]这 不是我所知的魔法
[01:52.95]I check my scare every time
[01:52.95]每次醒来
[01:56.84]I wake up from sleep.
[01:56.84]我都会去看看自己的伤疤
[02:03.33]That morning was a world I didn't know,
[02:03.33]那天早上 我身处未知的世界
[02:06.64]yet I knew what to do.
[02:06.64]却知道应做之事
[02:14.31]It took me a while to realize.
[02:14.31]我花了些时间才弄明白
[02:19.61]That the choice made was a foolish right one.
[02:19.61]我做出的是正确但愚蠢的选择
[02:24.07]So I lost sense of right.
[02:24.07]因此 我再也分不清什么是好 什么是坏
[02:27.52]It wasn't supposed to be like this.
[02:27.52]一切不该如此
[02:35.12]Tell me how the truth.
[02:35.12]告诉我何为真实吧
[02:38.07]I just can't lose hope.
[02:38.07]我绝不能失去希望
[02:40.81]I don't want your kindness to end up meaningless.
[02:40.81]我不愿让你的好意最终化为虚无
[02:47.05]Will this urging within me grow bigger someday?
[02:47.05]栖息于我内心的冲动 最终仍会膨胀失控吗？
[02:54.46]This wasn't magic as I knew it.
[02:54.46]这 不是我所知的魔法
[03:22.94]I hear the clock tick tock.
[03:22.94]时钟的滴答声传入耳中
[03:28.33]Where is the ending your desired.
[03:28.33]你想要的结局在哪里
[03:34.21]I'll look for it.
[03:34.21]我来帮你找到它吧
[03:37.39]By whatever means necessary.
[03:37.39]哪怕使出一切必要的手段
[03:43.29]Tell me how the fact.
[03:43.29]告诉我何为事实吧
[03:46.31]Blind to heart's shadows?
[03:46.31]是未曾察觉内心的灰影吗？
[03:48.99]I don't want your kindness to end up meaningless.
[03:48.99]我不愿让你的好意最终化为虚无
[03:54.78]I'll tell as many lies as need to.
[03:54.78]哪怕要我撒无数个必要的谎
[03:59.21]I'm not afraid.
[03:59.21]我并不害怕
[04:02.58]Is this the magic?
[04:02.58]这 就是魔法吗？
[04:05.10]I've just found hope.
[04:05.10]我找到了希望
[04:08.01]I'm trying to save you.
[04:08.01]我想要拯救你
[04:10.78]Forgive me even if it's in a way that's cruel to you.
[04:10.78]请原谅我——哪怕那对你来说是个多么残酷的行为
[04:16.96]Now I'll let your heart bloom.
[04:16.96]现在我会让你的心笼灿烂绽放
[04:19.59]Don't be afraid.
[04:19.59]别害怕
[04:21.28]Try closing your eyes.
[04:21.28]试着把眼睛闭上吧
[04:24.46]I'll always be with you.
[04:24.46]我会永远在你身边